    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27572" root="ظفر" body-key="Z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُفْرَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A certain plant, burning,</i> or <i>biting, to
the tongue,</i> (K, TA,) <i>resembling the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُفْر</span> [or <i>nail</i>]
<i>in its coming forth,</i> (TA,) <i>that has a beneficial
effect upon foul ulcers, and warts.</i> (K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُفْرَةُ العَجُوزِ</span> <i>The rounded head of prickles of
the</i> [<i>thistle called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَسَك</span>. (K, * TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also
the next paragraph.

